OL,3,GNEWSALast known sword maker hopes to
OL,4,Apass craft on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tradition of rapper sword dancing
OL,7,Fdeveloped on the coalfields of
OL,8,Fnorth-east England as early as the 18th
OL,9,FCentury. While dance troops continue to
OL,10,Fentertain audiences across the world,
OL,11,Fit is believed 81-year-old Frank Lee,
OL,12,Ffrom Cumbria, is now the last maker of
OL,13,Fthe swords so integral to the dance.
OL,15,FRetired professor of cultural studies
OL,16,FTrish Winter says rapper sword dancing,
OL,17,Fusing two-handled bending swords, was a
OL,18,F"North East story".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
