OL,3,GNEWSALast known sword maker hopes to
OL,4,Apass craft on
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeveloped in the mining communities of
OL,7,FNorthumberland and County Durham,
OL,8,FWinter says it evolved due to lay offs
OL,9,Fin the mines over winter when miners
OL,10,Fwere forced to find other ways to make
OL,11,Fmoney.
OL,13,F"There were traditions of sword dancing
OL,14,Faround Europe from the Middle Ages,"
OL,15,Fshe said.
